# RFC6154 again. An expunge in a regular mailbox moves the messages to
# trash rather than deleting them, and a message that is only in trash
# is not in all mail. Moving it back out of trash puts it in all mail
# again, with a new uid.
depends allmail
send 1
e create "Trash" (use (\Trash))
receive 1
e OK done
send 1
f select inbox
receive 9
* OK [CLOSED] I, missa est
* 20 EXISTS
* 20 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 21] next uid
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen \*)] permanent flags
* OK [UIDVALIDITY 1] uid validity
* OK [MAILBOXID (f...)] stable mailbox ID
f OK [READ-WRITE] done
send 1
g store 1 +flags \deleted
receive 2
* 1 FETCH (UID 1 FLAGS (\Deleted \Recent))
g OK done
send 1
h expunge
receive 2
* 1 EXPUNGE
h OK done
send 1
i select Trash
receive 9
* OK [CLOSED] I, missa est
* 1 EXISTS
* 1 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 2] next uid
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen \*)] permanent flags
* OK [UIDVALIDITY 1] uid validity
* OK [MAILBOXID (f...)] stable mailbox ID
i OK [READ-WRITE] done
send 1
j select All
receive 9
* OK [CLOSED] I, missa est
* 19 EXISTS
* 0 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 21] next uid
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen \*)] permanent flags
* OK [UIDVALIDITY 1] uid validity
* OK [MAILBOXID (f...)] stable mailbox ID
j OK [READ-WRITE] done
send 1
k select Trash
receive 9
* OK [CLOSED] I, missa est
* 1 EXISTS
* 0 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 2] next uid
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen \*)] permanent flags
* OK [UIDVALIDITY 1] uid validity
* OK [MAILBOXID (f...)] stable mailbox ID
k OK [READ-WRITE] done
send 1
l move 1 inbox
receive 2
* OK [COPYUID 1 1 21] moved
l OK done
send 1
m noop
receive 2
* 1 EXPUNGE
m OK done
send 1
n select All
receive 9
* OK [CLOSED] I, missa est
* 20 EXISTS
* 1 RECENT
* OK [UIDNEXT 22] next uid
* FLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen)
* OK [PERMANENTFLAGS (\Answered \Deleted \Draft \Flagged \Seen \*)] permanent flags
* OK [UIDVALIDITY 1] uid validity
* OK [MAILBOXID (f...)] stable mailbox ID
n OK [READ-WRITE] done
end
